WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.602
Follow the main navigation.

2
00:00:01.722 --> 00:00:04.520
Click Learn in the sidebar, then return Home.

3
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:08.030
The six core destinations stay available without scrolling.

4
00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:10.487
Use your learning path.

5
00:00:10.607 --> 00:00:14.950
Click Modules to inspect the next part of the learning path, then return Home.

6
00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:17.810
Progress bars reflect completed lessons.

7
00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:20.528
Find secondary sections.

8
00:00:20.648 --> 00:00:22.947
Open More resources and choose Tools.

9
00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:26.155
The separate account menu contains profile and settings.

10
00:00:26.275 --> 00:00:29.003
Pro tools are shown in this demonstration account.

